    "tags": [],
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Hammer kindness into armor.</em></p><p>When you finish <strong>crafting or sanctifying</strong> a weapon, shield, armor, or emblem for an ally, you bind a little of your own guarded gentleness into it.</p><ul><li>Once per <strong>scenario</strong>, when an ally uses an item you personally forged or sanctified to contribute to a meaningful victory (combat, negotiation, or symbolic act), your Domain gains <strong>+10 Soft Power marks</strong> for the next turn.</li><li>This is an echo, not a coupon. If multiple such victories happen, the GM adjudicates the most impactful one.</li></ul>",
